        <OtherAbstract Type="Publisher" Language="rus">
            <AbstractText>Issledovany farmakokineticheskie svoĭstva proizvodnogo imidazobenzimidazola soedineniia RU-1205 pri podkozhnom vvedenii krolikam v vide substantsii i lekarstvennoĭ forme (liofilizat dlia prigotovleniia in&quot;ektsiĭ) v doze 25 mg/kg. Ustanovleno, chto dlia liofilizata izuchaemogo veshchestva otnositel'naia biodostupnost' sostavliaet 81,94%. V testakh “goriachaia plastina” i “uksusnye korchi” pokazano, chto lekarstvennaia forma i substantsiia issleduemogo veshchestva okazyvaiut odinakovyĭ anal'geticheskiĭ éffekt.</AbstractText>
        </OtherAbstract>
